        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, scooter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, scooter
The data set reflects the disposal of a scooter of 90kg. Aluminium and steel parts are fully recycled. Plastics are incinerated, batteries are treated.;
UUID: 1e0a35ab-8166-4c06-8c73-6d6e3881583c
This data set includes the disposal of all remaining parts, that are not recycled. All recycled parts are attributed to the reuse process (cut-off). Transport for recycled materials included.
Location: Data for disposal of vehicle parts in Europe.
Technology: unknown
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Some data derived from car disposal
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1e0a35ab-8166-4c06-8c73-6d6e3881583c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
